Whoever marries you, just be as bold as a flower and call me. The scene is not as easy as it is now. Go out to the aerospace industry. What are you doing? Girls, it’s better to be gentle.

8
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:23,090
I don’t need you to teach me. It’s between our two families.

9
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:24,410
For the sake of so many years of friendship

10
