Take care of me and protect me?

24
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,540
Mr. Zhang, I will handle it

25
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:07,550
He's here to disturb my work. If you ask him to go out and ask you out, what assistant is just destroying people who run errands and serve people? If you want

26
